[22.494643, "o", "Model       gpt-5-mini, prompt v4 (cached response)\r\r\nReport?     yes\r\r\nSummary     The reporter states there is an XSS (cross-site scripting) vulnerability in the search box of AcmeShop.\r\r\nProduct     AcmeShop (version unspecified)\r\r\nCWE         CWE-79\r\r\nCVSS 3.1    withheld, not enough evidence (model guess: CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N)\r\r\nInferred    AC, PR, UI, S, C, I, A\r\r\nConfidence  low\r\r\nFlags       thin_report, cvss_provisional\r\r\nNext step   Request a reproducible PoC and detailed technical information: exact AcmeShop version, the search input URL, example payload(s) and observed output, and whether the input is reflected or stored; if confirmed, prioritize fixing by output encoding/escaping or proper input sanitization in the search results rendering.\r\r\nEvidence\r\r\n  - Statement of vulnerability and location: \"Found an XSS in the search box of AcmeShop. Please fix.\"\r\r\n\r\r\n[a]pprove  [e]dit  [r]eject > "]
